          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wulub kwiocwiny kum dhanu ceke, man dwokrileng’ ma ng’atu moko mbe m’umbe kudo ma bineno Rwoth: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.29.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Poi 29:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ma wubed ko ku weng’wu kara ng’atu moko kud urem kum bero pa Mungu; kara ulag akece kud uwok m’unyai can i iwu, man uketh dupa gicid ni kume; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.25.29+GEN.25.30+GEN.25.31+GEN.25.32+GEN.25.33+GEN.25.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tha 25:29-34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kara won tarwang’ kud ubed nuti, kadi ng’atu ma rac calu Esau, m’uloko camupacu pare gire ku cemo ma wang’ acel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.27.30+GEN.27.31+GEN.27.32+GEN.27.33+GEN.27.34+GEN.27.35+GEN.27.36+GEN.27.37+GEN.27.38+GEN.27.39+GEN.27.40"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tha 27:30-40",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum wung’eyo nia yo ku ng’eye kan eyenyo ecam pacu mi mugisa, jukwere; kum enwang’u kamoko ngo m’elok ko pidoic pa won, kadok eyenye hai ku piwang’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:18"
